{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/maison-margiela-residence-alta-developer-palm-jumeirah","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":1302,"crm_id":"28","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Maison Margiela Residence","slug":"maison-margiela-residence-alta-developer-palm-jumeirah","display_address":"Palm Jumeirah","building_type":["apartment","duplex","penthouse"],"completion_year":"2028","developer":"Alta Developer","price":16500000,"display_price":"16.5M","lattitude":6139481.746800202,"longitude":2892128.7097218856,"min_bedrooms":2,"max_bedrooms":4,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Maison Margiela Residence at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/palm-jumeirah/\">Palm Jumeirah</a> by Alta Real Estate Development marks the fashion house’s first branded residential project in Dubai real estate. Located on the prestigious island, this waterfront development offers panoramic views of the Arabian Gulf, Burj Al Arab, and the Dubai skyline.&nbsp;</p><p>The project includes a limited collection of 25 residences, featuring 2-, 3-, and 4-bedroom units, as well as a 4-bedroom duplex, and one exclusive penthouse, La Maison Blanche. The penthouse spans 18,804 sq. ft. across two levels and offers five bedrooms, private terraces, a sculptural pool, a jacuzzi, and 360-degree sea and skyline views.&nbsp;</p><p>Each home is designed with bespoke materials such as travertine, marmorino, and brushed metal, blending organic textures with refined finishes. Amenities include a private beach, gym, spa, screening room, art gallery, residents’ lounge, yoga studio, and curated concierge services, all reflecting Maison Margiela’s understated luxury and design philosophy.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Banner_625578838e.jpg","hash":"Banner_625578838e","name":"Maison Margiela Residence at Palm Jumeirah by Alta Banner Image"},"banner_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Banner_625578838e.jpg","hash":"Banner_625578838e","name":"Maison Margiela Residence at Palm Jumeirah by Alta Banner Image"},"media_images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Gallery_11_9604ba29ef.jpg","hash":"Gallery_11_9604ba29ef","name":"Grand golden facade entrance - Maison Margiela Residence, Palm Jumeirah."},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Gallery_2_2330763581.jpg","hash":"Gallery_2_2330763581","name":"Pool at Maison Margiela Residence, Palm Jumeirah."},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Gallery_3_ec6e74647d.jpg","hash":"Gallery_3_ec6e74647d","name":"Infinity pool terrace at Maison Margiela Residence, Palm Jumeirah."},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Gallery_9_1b2d2cf459.jpg","hash":"Gallery_9_1b2d2cf459","name":"Bedroom View - Maison Margiela Residence, Palm Jumeirah."},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Gallery_8_3d0971b0cb.jpg","hash":"Gallery_8_3d0971b0cb","name":"Dining Area - Maison Margiela Residence"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Gallery_12_64e020b539.jpg","hash":"Gallery_12_64e020b539","name":"Luxury living room with panoramic views and refined beige interiors at Maison Margiela Residence, Palm Jumeirah."},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Gallery_6_f1b97f4ca8.jpg","hash":"Gallery_6_f1b97f4ca8","name":"Living Area - Maison Margiela Residence, Palm Jumeirah."},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Gallery_4_2c0e3cbba1.jpg","hash":"Gallery_4_2c0e3cbba1","name":"Sun loungers - Maison Margiela Residence"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Gallery_1_dfd24d8066.jpg","hash":"Gallery_1_dfd24d8066","name":"Contemporary lounge with elegant neutral interiors, textured stone finishes, and lush garden views at Maison Margiela Residence, Palm Jumeirah."},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Gallery_5_e1d5f87526.jpg","hash":"Gallery_5_e1d5f87526","name":"Indoor pool lounge - Maison Margiela Residence"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Gallery_7_6613c994ae.jpg","hash":"Gallery_7_6613c994ae","name":"Bathroom - Maison Margiela Residence."}],"images":[],"characteristics_module":{"id":1839,"cta":{"id":2637,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Find out more","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#register-interest"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Selling_Point_2079e244f2.jpg","hash":"Selling_Point_2079e244f2","name":"Maison Margiela Residence at Palm Jumeirah Building View"},"style":null,"title":"Unveiling Maison Margiela Residence at Palm Jumeirah by Alta Real Estate","heading":"Unique Selling Points","bg_color":"blue","image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<ul><li data-start=\"139\" data-end=\"343\">Prime Location: Situated on the iconic Palm Jumeirah, offering panoramic views of the Arabian Gulf, Burj Al Arab, and the Dubai skyline, one of Dubai’s most prestigious addresses.</li><li data-start=\"344\" data-end=\"532\">Branded Residences: The first-ever Maison Margiela-branded residential project, blending haute couture fashion with architectural innovation and refined minimalism.</li><li data-start=\"533\" data-end=\"676\">Exclusive Collection: Limited to only 25 residences, ensuring privacy, exclusivity, and prestige for discerning homeowners.</li><li data-start=\"677\" data-end=\"902\">Residence Options: A curated mix of 2-bedroom, 3-bedroom, 4-bedroom, and 4-bedroom duplex units, plus the signature La Maison Blanche Penthouse with five bedrooms and 18,804 sq ft of space.</li><li data-start=\"903\" data-end=\"1094\">La Maison Blanche Penthouse: A one-of-one residence featuring two levels, 360° sea views, sculptural pool, jacuzzi, garden terraces, and bespoke interiors.</li><li data-start=\"1095\" data-end=\"1310\">Design &amp; Craftsmanship: Interiors use natural materials like travertine, marmorino, and brushed metal, reflecting Maison Margiela’s philosophy of quiet elegance and craftsmanship.</li><li data-start=\"1311\" data-end=\"1490\">Luxury Amenities: Includes private beach access, residents’ lounge, spa, gym, infinity pool, yoga studio, art gallery, and curated library.</li><li data-start=\"1491\" data-end=\"1685\">Tailored Services: 24-hour concierge, valet, butler, property management, and bespoke in-residence experiences such as wellness treatments and private dining.</li><li data-start=\"1686\" data-end=\"1853\">Maison Margiela Privileges: Access to personal stylists, fashion show invitations, product personalization, and exclusive events for residents.</li></ul>","design_title":null},"location_tile":{"id":1840,"cta":{"id":2638,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Get more information","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#payment-plans"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Location_Map_b679ccca6f.jpg","hash":"Location_Map_b679ccca6f","name":"Location-Map.jpg"},"style":null,"title":"Experience Island Luxury at Maison Margiela Residence, Palm Jumeirah","heading":"Location","bg_color":"blue","add_place":[],"image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<p>Located in the heart of Palm Jumeirah, Maison Margiela Residences offer an exceptional living experience in one of Dubai’s most prestigious neighborhoods. The island’s world-renowned lifestyle, serene beachfront, and unmatched connectivity make it a premier choice for global investors as well as homeowners.</p><ul><li>7 minutes to Al Sufouh</li><li>8 minutes to Dubai Media City</li><li>9 minutes to Madinat Jumeirah</li><li>10 minutes to Dubai Internet Cit